# Component Development Guidelines

## React Components

- Use WordPress `@wordpress/element` instead of direct React import
- Implement WordPress and WooCommerce hooks system
- Follow component lifecycle patterns:
  - WordPress for general components
  - WooCommerce for store-related components

## State Management
- WordPress block editor stores for Gutenberg components
- Follow WordPress data layer patterns
- Use Redux-style state management when appropriate

## Component Structure
- Follow WordPress component patterns
- Use functional components with hooks
- Implement proper prop types and documentation
- Follow accessibility guidelines

## Best Practices
- Use WordPress i18n for translations
- Implement proper error boundaries
- Follow WordPress coding standards for JS/JSX
- Use WordPress utilities and helpers when available

## Documentation
- Follow JSDoc conventions
- Document component prop types

## Accessibility
- Follow WCAG 2.1 guidelines
- Implement proper ARIA attributes
- Ensure keyboard navigation
- Test with screen readers 